#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:194
msgid ""
"All major search engines — Google, Bing, and Yandex — discover the sitemap "
"automatically via the Sitemap: directive in robots.txt. No manual action is "
"required. The buttons below send an immediate ping so the engine recrawls "
"the sitemap now rather than waiting for its next scheduled robots.txt check."
msgstr ""
"Alla stora sökmotorer — Google, Bing och Yandex — upptäcker automatiskt "
"sitemap via Sitemap: direktivet i robots.txt. Ingen manuell åtgärd krävs. "
"Knappena nedan skickar en omedelbar ping så att sökmotorn recrawlar sitemap "
"nu istället för att vänta på nästa schemalagda robots.txt-kontroll."

